notes = "GoodberryBatch extends CreatedItemsLifetime and owns exact created berry item UUIDs until the caster long rest. Real admitted inventory/items and the existing Goodberry creation/consumption/heal outcomes own their presentation. The caster batch ledger adds no persistent berry body or synthetic consumption event."
